('The Stranded', '430 Strand, WC2R 0JR', 'Strand', 'open', 'Opened 2026', '2026-02-01', 'From the people behind the Euston Tap and the Jackalope. Continental lagers and ales.', 'Londonist', 'https://londonist.com/london/drink/london-s-best-new-pubs-of-2026', (select id from public.pubs where city = 'London' and lower(replace(name, '’', '''')) = lower('The Stranded') and address ilike '%Strand%' limit 1)),
